How about spellbooks of polymorph, cancellation or teleport away?  With
polymorph you can polypile for any item you need.  If you know
cancellation you can ditch your wands of cancellation.  And teleport
away makes going through the dungeon much faster.

Otherwise it doesn't sound like you need anything that hasn't been
suggested or that you don't have.  You might save a wish for a magic
marker since yours only has 45 charges left.  And if I were you I
wouldn't wish for a saddle knowing that there is one out there
somewhere.  If you knew detect monsters you could find that horse
pretty easily.



